<div id="info-panel" style="display: none;">
  <!-- Where an extension adds to About, ahead of OSCAR's own words: what this
       OSCAR is, to whom. Empty in OSCAR itself. -->
  <div id="about-extras" class="oscar-about-extras"></div>
  <div class="info-panel-label">
    <b>OSCAR</b> is a tool to create custom and beautiful Graphical User
    Interfaces to control interactive installations <br /><br />
    For tutorials and help you can refer to
    <a class="o-link" target="_blank" href="https://www.createwithoscar.com/">our webpage</a>, and you can
    <a class="o-link" target="_blank" href="https://forms.gle/1pGiDJDh3jur8Tq68">sign up for OSCAR news</a>
    to hear about new releases.

    <br /><br />Being a free and open source project contributors and supporters
    are extremely welcome. OSCAR is looking for collaborators all the time.
    Share your project and let us be part of them, please let us know!

    <div class="about-actions">
      <a id="report-problem" class="o-btn" href="#">Report a problem</a>
      <a id="suggest-feature" class="o-btn" href="#">Suggest a feature</a>
    </div>

    <div class="about-note">
      Both open GitHub in your browser, with the version details filled in. No
      GitHub account? Email
      <a class="o-link" href="mailto:hello@createwithoscar.com">hello@createwithoscar.com</a>
      instead — it reaches the same place.
    </div>

    <div id="about-version" class="about-note"></div>

    <!-- The telemetry switch, filled by oscar_editor.js from /telemetry-state:
         the whole list of what OSCAR can say is lib/telemetry.js, one screen. -->
    <div id="about-telemetry" class="about-note" style="display: none">
      <label class="oscar-telemetry-row">
        <input id="about-telemetry-switch" type="checkbox" />
        Share anonymous usage counts (which features are used, never your
        projects, addresses or what the rig says) to help decide what OSCAR
        builds next. The complete list lives in
        <a
          class="o-link"
          target="_blank"
          href="https://github.com/trafalmejo/OSCAR/blob/master/lib/telemetry.js"
          >lib/telemetry.js</a
        >.
      </label>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
